# Local isolated OAST setup — no public domain or IP required.
# Everything runs inside Docker on oast-net (172.30.0.0/24).
#
# OAST server static IP:  172.30.0.10
# OAST domain:            *.oast.local
# Web UI:                 http://localhost:8080
# SPA:                    http://localhost:4200
#
# To trigger a DNS interaction from the backend, use:
#   GET http://localhost:4200/api/ssrf-test?url=http://abc123.oast.local/
# Then watch http://localhost:8080 for the DNS + HTTP entries.
